\begin{definition}\label{def:L2Martingales.norm}
  \uses{def:L2Martingales, def:limitProcess}
We define a norm on $\mathcal{M}^2$ by
\begin{align*}
  \Vert M \Vert = \Vert M_\infty \Vert_{L^2}
